class_name SpriteArt
extends RefCounted

## Hand-authored pixel art. Every sprite is a square grid of single characters
## resolved through its own palette, where "." means transparent.
## Run tools/sprite_forge.tscn to bake these into PNG files under OUTPUT_DIRECTORY.

const OUTPUT_DIRECTORY := "res://assets/sprites"

## Shared rescue-robot palette (same language as Tobor's pawn).
